  "reflectionText": "The psalmist sang: may God be merciful to us. Let the nations be glad and sing for joy. The earth has yielded its increase. God will bless us. All the ends of the earth shall fear him. What is it to sing a song that calls every nation under heaven into the same gladness, while you are still standing in only one corner of the field?"
}
